                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Faces of Illusion: The Twin Phantoms is a beautiful hidden-object adventure with a fascinating theatrical setting.\r\n\r\nThe visuals are excellent, and I really enjoyed the mysterious story and the feeling of uncovering secrets behind the scenes.\r\n\r\nThe puzzles aren't extremely difficult, but they fit nicely into the story and don't interrupt the pace.\r\n\r\nIf you like story-driven hidden-object games, I think this one is definitely worth your time.\r\n\r\nEnjoy :)",
